1
00:00:00,205 --> 00:00:04,705
(Sheldon:)Come on out, merry pranksters.
Take a bow.

2
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:10,880
- You should've seen your face.
- Yes.

3
00:00:11,049 --> 00:00:16,559
(Sheldon:)There's nothing quite like the slightly
widened eyes of mildly startled.

4
00:00:16,721 --> 00:00:18,221
(Howard:)Come on, admit it. We got you.

5
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:22,520
(Sheldon:)Please. Fright depends on
an element of surprise.

6
00:00:22,686 --> 00:00:26,026
(Sheldon:)The simple fact is,
because I am much smarter than you...

7
00:00:26,189 --> 00:00:28,189
(Sheldon:)...and able to anticipate your actions...

8
00:00:28,358 --> 00:00:33,568
(Sheldon:)...it is highly unlikely that you two rubes
could ever surprise me.

9
00:00:33,738 --> 00:00:37,028
- He's probably right.
- We can't beat him. He's just too smart.

10
00:00:37,659 --> 00:00:38,989
(Sheldon:)Gentlemen.

11
00:00:44,207 --> 00:00:46,377
Okay, who had money on "faints"?

12
00:00:46,543 --> 00:00:47,873
I had "pee his pants."

13
00:00:48,461 --> 00:00:53,021
(Leonard:)Hang on.
Looks like everyone's a winner.

